From 932fe546ce247951450472bb7e13af8197169ed4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fabio Lima <fabiolimace@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Jan 2026 17:44:18 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Update Portuguese language

Summary:

* improve pronunciation list;
* improve pronunciation rules;
* improve phonemes definitions;
* improve MBrola pronunciation;
* add documentation for Portuguese;
* add normalization for Unicode Latin-1 Supplement;
* add 250+ pronunciation corrections to the main dictionary;
* add 900+ abbreviations and acronyms from technology, politics, etc;
* add 3500+ words and names from technology, history, philosophy, etc.
