+// Conditional rules:
+// ?1	European Portuguese
+// ?2	Brazilian Portuguese
+// ?3	Epenthetic [I] between consonants (used to avoid bad diphones in Brazilian MBROLA voices)
+// ?4	MBROLA ajustments (used to modify nasal vowels, modify diphthongs, and for other adaptations in MBrola voices)
 
-// $1..$7  change the stressed syllable from the 1st to the 7th
-// $text   specify another "sounds like" word, rather than specifying the phoneme string of a word
+// Change the opening of mid vowels:
+//  $alt	change [e] or [o] in the stressed syllable to open [E] or [O].
+//  $alt2	change [E] or [O] in the stressed syllable to closed [e] or [o].
 
